title: Add `pallet-assets-forwarder`
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds `pallet-assets-forwarder`, which lets any signed account replicate an asset of a local
    `fungibles` registry onto a sibling chain over XCM. The destination force-creates the replica,
    owned by the pallet's sovereign account there, from the minimum balance and sufficiency read
    from the registry. A permissionless `sync_asset_status` call re-sends the values after they
    change, and a manager origin can remove the local record and release the caller's deposit.
crates:
- name: pallet-assets-forwarder
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: minor
